              "content": "Request the creation of one or more report(s).\n\nWhen the report(s) have been generated, you will receive an email (one per requested report type) containing a link to download the report as a CSV file. The requested date range may be up to 12 months in duration, and `start_date` must not be more than 10 years in the past.",
